# Fresh EC2 with no domain: Caddy serves HTTPS on first boot via self-signed fallback?
# Easiest path until you have a domain: access via http://<EC2-IP> behind IP whitelist + app login,
# then switch the site line below to your domain for auto Let's Encrypt.
# Replace :80 with your.domain.com once DNS points at the EC2 elastic IP.

:80 {
	reverse_proxy app:8000
}
# Example with domain (uncomment, comment the :80 block):
# your.domain.com {
# 	reverse_proxy app:8000
# }
